  "decision_conditions": [
    "Condition : 1 - The proposed outbuilding by reason of its bulk, appearance, design and positioning would result in the overdevelopment of the site and would be out of character with this property, those adjoining and the area generally. This would be detrimental to the appearance of the area and would result in adverse effects on the adjoining landowners including a loss of outlook and privacy together with overshadowing of and an excessive sense of enclosure to neighbouring gardens. The proposal would be contrary to policies ENV-B.1.1 (New development), H.6.4 (Extensions and Alterations), T.4.6 (Off-street parking) and T.4.4 (Road Safety) of the Council's Unitary Development Plan, and Section 7 of the Residential Extension Guidelines."
